I am sitting on my bed.
My mobile is in my hand.
My health is not fine today.
There is severe pain in my head and body.
I write a message to my colleague Rohan at the office.
"Good morning Rohan," I type.
"I am not well today."
"I have a severe cold and fever."
"In this condition, I cannot come to the office by bus."
"Therefore, I am taking sick leave today."
"I will stay at home and rest."
I send the message.
After a short time, Rohan's reply comes.
He writes, "Do not worry, Maya."
"You can rest at home today."
"I will inform the manager at the office about this matter."
I feel a little relief now.
I place the mobile device on the bed.
Next, I get ready to go to the clinic.
